UnitMutinyModule::constructor
├── when deployed with valid params
│   └── it stores Quartermaster Hats captain hat id crew hat id and latest mutiny id zero
└── when params are invalid
    ├── it reverts when quartermaster is zero
    ├── it reverts when Hats is zero
    ├── it reverts when initial captain is zero
    ├── it reverts when captain hat id is zero
    └── it reverts when crew hat id is zero


UnitMutinyModule::startMutiny
├── when crew opens mutiny with valid successor and positive crew supply
│   ├── it calls Quartermaster setMutinyActive true
│   ├── it increments latest mutiny id
│   ├── it records proposed successor eligible count and opens round
│   └── it emits MutinyStarted
├── when a mutiny is already open
│   └── it reverts with MutinyModule_MutinyAlreadyActive
├── when proposed successor is zero
│   └── it reverts with MutinyModule_InvalidSuccessor
├── when proposed is current captain
│   └── it reverts with MutinyModule_InvalidSuccessor
├── when proposed already wears captain hat
│   └── it reverts with MutinyModule_InvalidSuccessor
├── when caller is not crew
│   └── it reverts with MutinyModule_NotEligibleCrew
└── when crew hat supply is zero
    └── it reverts with MutinyModule_InvalidMutiny


UnitMutinyModule::castVote
├── when round is open
│   ├── when voter casts nay
│   │   └── it does not increment yea votes
│   └── when another voter casts yea
│       └── it increments yea votes
├── when voter votes twice
│   └── it reverts with MutinyModule_AlreadyVoted
├── when voter is not crew
│   └── it reverts with MutinyModule_NotEligibleCrew
└── when mutiny id is not open
    └── it reverts with MutinyModule_InvalidMutiny


UnitMutinyModule::executeMutiny
├── when strict majority yea and EOA successor without crew
│   ├── it calls Hats transferHat captain from former to successor
│   ├── it calls Quartermaster mintCrewFromMutiny for former captain
│   ├── it calls Quartermaster setMutinyActive false
│   └── it marks round executed and closed
├── when EOA successor already has crew
│   ├── it calls Hats transferHat for captain
│   └── it calls Quartermaster crewHandoffForMutiny
├── when successor is a contract
│   ├── it calls Hats transferHat for captain
│   └── it calls Quartermaster mintCrewFromMutiny for former only
├── when yea votes do not exceed half of eligible crew count
│   └── it reverts with MutinyModule_NotExecutable
└── when tracked captain does not hold captain hat
    └── it reverts with MutinyModule_NotExecutable


UnitMutinyModule::lifecycle
└── when execute completes and crew starts a new mutiny
    ├── it opens a second mutiny round
    └── it increments latest mutiny id
